  "solution": {
    "text": "In diborane, all boron atoms are $\\mathrm{sp}^3$ hybridised. It is diamagnetic and contains $3 \\mathrm{C}-2 \\mathrm{e}$ bonds. There are two types of hydrogens $-$ terminal and bridging.",
